            "action_name": {
              "value": "Obliteration Beam"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(arcane, evocation, force)\n\nThe spiritbound aluum transforms the captured soul's essence into raw magical energy, channeling the spirit into a beam that deals 20d6 force damage in a 30-foot line (DC 38 basic Reflex save). The remaining fragments of the captured soul are released to the Great Beyond. The spiritbound aluum can't use Obliteration Beam again for 1d4 rounds."
